#N canvas 20 20 1700 1450 12;
#X text 20 20 e_verb -- the drums' one reverb \, in c_kit: each track's send \, and its size and damping \, the kit's (Brendan \, 2026-11-05). Four of Freeverb's combs \, each damped by a one-pole low-pass in its feedback \, into two of its allpasses: mono \, and small enough for the Organelle's one core. ref/module/sequencer.md, f 70;
#X text 20 130 creation arg: c_kit's \$0 \, for the throws. In: the tracks' sends \, thrown to \$1-verb by every c_voice and e_delay. inlet: send <pad> <0-100> \, every track's send \, size <0-100> and damping <0-100> \, from c_steps through c_kit. Out: the reverb alone \, wet \, thrown to c_kit's \$1-out., f 70;
#X obj 20 300 catch~ \$1-verb;
#X obj 1000 300 inlet;
#X obj 1000 340 route send size damping;
#X obj 20 340 *~ 0.35;
#X obj 20 640 *~ 0.25;
#X obj 20 400 +~;
#X obj 20 440 delwrite~ \$0-c1 50;
#X obj 20 500 delread~ \$0-c1 25.31;
#X obj 80 540 lop~ 4562;
#X obj 80 580 *~ 0.84;
#X obj 250 400 +~;
#X obj 250 440 delwrite~ \$0-c2 50;
#X obj 250 500 delread~ \$0-c2 26.94;
#X obj 310 540 lop~ 4562;
#X obj 310 580 *~ 0.84;
#X obj 480 400 +~;
#X obj 480 440 delwrite~ \$0-c3 50;
#X obj 480 500 delread~ \$0-c3 28.96;
#X obj 540 540 lop~ 4562;
#X obj 540 580 *~ 0.84;
#X obj 710 400 +~;
#X obj 710 440 delwrite~ \$0-c4 50;
#X obj 710 500 delread~ \$0-c4 30.75;
#X obj 770 540 lop~ 4562;
#X obj 770 580 *~ 0.84;
#X obj 20 700 +~;
#X obj 20 740 delwrite~ \$0-a1 30;
#X obj 200 700 delread~ \$0-a1 12.61;
#X obj 200 740 *~ 0.5;
#X obj 200 820 -~;
#X obj 20 900 +~;
#X obj 20 940 delwrite~ \$0-a2 30;
#X obj 200 900 delread~ \$0-a2 10;
#X obj 200 940 *~ 0.5;
#X obj 200 1020 -~;
#X obj 20 1120 throw~ \$1-out;
#X obj 1000 400 expr 0.7 + 0.28 * \$f1 / 100;
#X obj 1000 440 t f f f f;
#X obj 1250 400 expr (1 - 0.7 * \$f1 / 100) * 7018.7;
#X obj 1250 440 t f f f f;
#X obj 1000 520 array define \$0-sends 16;
#X obj 1000 580 unpack f f;
#X obj 1150 660 f;
#X obj 1000 620 - 1;
#X obj 1000 660 t b b f;
#X obj 1150 700 tabwrite \$0-sends;
#X obj 1000 740 array sum \$0-sends;
#X obj 1000 780 > 0;
#X obj 1000 820 t f f;
#X obj 1000 860 sel 1 0;
#X obj 1000 900 t b b;
#X msg 1000 940 1;
#X obj 1000 1180 switch~;
#X obj 400 1120 env~ 4096 2048;
#X obj 400 1160 < 20;
#X obj 400 1200 change;
#X obj 400 1240 sel 1 0;
#X msg 600 1240 stop;
#X obj 700 1000 del 300;
#X obj 700 1040 f;
#X obj 700 1080 sel 0;
#X obj 700 1120 t b b;
#X msg 700 1160 0;
#X msg 800 1160 clear;
#X obj 800 1200 t a a a a a a;
#X text 1000 1240 size is the combs' feedback \, 0.7 to 0.98 as Freeverb's room size: about half a second at 0 to ten at 100. damping sets their low-passes \, from none at 0 to about 2.1 kHz at 100. Each starts at 50 in its boxes and is not set at load: c_steps tells c_kit every effect's value at load (ref/module/sequencer.md)., f 50;
#X text 20 1300 switch~: on while any track's send is above 0 \, and when every one is 0 \, off once the reverb has been below -80 dBFS for 300 ms: its tail has died. Its delay lines are cleared then. A switch~ starts off. While it is off every throw to it is zeros \, every send being 0 \, so the catch~ never fills up., f 60;
